This is about the fundamental promise of American health care equity when we fund excellence equitably

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.640
Every single citizen thrives no matter where they live. Absolutely

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.440
Think about that luxury car in a bicycle budget

